OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners want more land
OL,4,Aprotected from housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter a successful campaign getting
OL,7,Fparkland protected, residents in a
OL,8,FNorfolk town are asking for more space
OL,9,Fto be given the same safeguards from
OL,10,Fdevelopment.
OL,12,FSeven acres (2.8 hectares) of land
OL,13,Fknown as Harding's Pits, beside the
OL,14,FRiver Great Ouse in King's Lynn, will
OL,15,Fbe preserved after it was given
OL,16,F"village green status" by the county
OL,17,Fcouncil.
OL,19,FThe Harding's Pits Community
OL,20,FAssociation had campaigned for the past
OL,21,F30 years to keep the area as leisure
OL,22,Fspace.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
