OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners want more land
OL,4,Aprotected from housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FNext, the group wants the protection to
OL,7,Fbe extended to the east side, which has
OL,8,Fbeen earmarked for up to 50 houses in
OL,9,FKing's Lynn and West Norfolk Borough
OL,10,FCouncil's local plan. The authority has
OL,11,Fbeen approached for comment.
